{"seq":1,"slug":"websocket-and-sse","title":"WebSocket 与 SSE","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations/websocket-and-sse","wordCount":1957,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"websocket-与-sse\">WebSocket 与 SSE</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WebSocket（W3C 标准，2011）与 Server-Sent Events（SSE，2009）是 Web 实时通信的两大主流传输协议。WebSocket 提供双向长连接，延迟极低，适合聊天、协作编辑和游戏场景；SSE 是基于 HTTP 的服务器到客户端单向流，实现简单，适合通知推送、实时动态和 AI 流式输出。相比早期的长轮询（Long Polling）和 Comet 技术，两者在性能和开发体验上有大幅提升。本节介绍 WebSocket 与 SSE 的协议细节、浏览器 API、性能特征、扩展方案、适用场景以及常见陷阱。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>WebSocket</th>\n<th>SSE</th>\n<th>长轮询</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>方向</td>\n<td>双向通信</td>\n<td>仅服务器→客户端</td>\n<td>模拟双向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议</td>\n<td>WS/WSS 升级</td>\n<td>HTTP</td>\n<td>HTTP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重连</td>\n<td>需手动实现</td>\n<td>内置自动重连</td>\n<td>需手动实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代理兼容</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n<td>一般支持</td>\n<td>易支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>聊天/协作/游戏</td>\n<td>通知/动态流</td>\n<td>旧浏览器兼容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"websocket-协议\">WebSocket 协议</h2><p><strong>从 HTTP 升级连接</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"GET /chat HTTP/1.1&#10;Host: example.com&#10;Upgrade: websocket&#10;Connection: Upgrade&#10;Sec-WebSocket-Key: dGhlIHNhbXBsZSBub25jZQ==&#10;Sec-WebSocket-Version: 13\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>GET /chat HTTP/1.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Host: example.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Upgrade: websocket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Connection: Upgrade</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Sec-WebSocket-Key: dGhlIHNhbXBsZSBub25jZQ==</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Sec-WebSocket-Version: 13</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>服务器响应</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"HTTP/1.1 101 Switching Protocols&#10;Upgrade: websocket&#10;Connection: Upgrade&#10;Sec-WebSocket-Accept: s3pPLMBiTxaQ9kYGzzhZRbK+xOo=\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 101 Switching Protocols</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Upgrade: websocket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Connection: Upgrade</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Sec-WebSocket-Accept: s3pPLMBiTxaQ9kYGzzhZRbK+xOo=</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>升级完成后</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>TCP 连接持续保持。</li>\n<li>双方可随时发送数据帧。</li>\n<li>支持二进制和文本格式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"客户端-api\">客户端 API</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const ws = new WebSocket(&#39;wss://example.com/chat&#39;);&#10;&#10;ws.addEventListener(&#39;open&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;Connected&#39;);&#10;  ws.send(&#39;Hello&#39;);&#10;});&#10;&#10;ws.addEventListener(&#39;message&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;Received:&#39;, event.data);&#10;});&#10;&#10;ws.addEventListener(&#39;close&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;Closed&#39;, event.code, event.reason);&#10;});&#10;&#10;ws.addEventListener(&#39;error&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.error(&#39;Error&#39;, event);&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 发送数据&#10;ws.send(&#39;text&#39;);&#10;ws.send(JSON.stringify({ type: &#39;msg&#39;, text: &#39;hello&#39; }));&#10;ws.send(new Uint8Array([1, 2, 3])); // 二进制&#10;&#10;// 关闭连接&#10;ws.close(1000, &#39;Bye&#39;); // 正常关闭\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const ws = new WebSocket('wss://example.com/chat');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ws.addEventListener('open', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('Connected');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ws.send('Hello');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ws.addEventListener('message', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('Received:', event.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ws.addEventListener('close', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('Closed', event.code, event.reason);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ws.addEventListener('error', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.error('Error', event);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 发送数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ws.send('text');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ws.send(JSON.stringify({ type: 'msg', text: 'hello' }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ws.send(new Uint8Array([1, 2, 3])); // 二进制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 关闭连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ws.close(1000, 'Bye'); // 正常关闭</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"服务端实现-node-js\">服务端实现（Node.js）</h2><p><strong>使用 ws 库</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { WebSocketServer } from &#39;ws&#39;;&#10;&#10;const wss = new WebSocketServer({ port: 8080 });&#10;&#10;wss.on(&#39;connection&#39;, (ws) =&gt; {&#10;  ws.on(&#39;message&#39;, (data) =&gt; {&#10;    // 广播给所有客户端&#10;    wss.clients.forEach((client) =&gt; {&#10;      if (client.readyState === ws.OPEN) {&#10;        client.send(data);&#10;      }&#10;    });&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { WebSocketServer } from 'ws';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const wss = new WebSocketServer({ port: 8080 });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wss.on('connection', (ws) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ws.on('message', (data) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 广播给所有客户端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    wss.clients.forEach((client) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if (client.readyState === ws.OPEN) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        client.send(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>其他语言实现</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Python：websockets 库。</li>\n<li>Go：gorilla/websocket 库。</li>\n<li>Rust：tokio-tungstenite 库。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sse-协议\">SSE 协议</h2><p><strong>基于 HTTP</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"GET /events HTTP/1.1&#10;Accept: text/event-stream\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>GET /events HTTP/1.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Accept: text/event-stream</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>服务器响应</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"HTTP/1.1 200 OK&#10;Content-Type: text/event-stream&#10;Cache-Control: no-cache&#10;Connection: keep-alive&#10;&#10;data: hello&#10;&#10;data: world&#10;&#10;event: update&#10;data: {&quot;foo&quot;: &quot;bar&quot;}&#10;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 200 OK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Type: text/event-stream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Cache-Control: no-cache</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Connection: keep-alive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data: hello</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data: world</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>event: update</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data: {\"foo\": \"bar\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>格式说明</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>data:</code> 事件负载内容。</li>\n<li><code>event:</code> 命名事件类型。</li>\n<li><code>id:</code> 事件 ID（用于断线续传）。</li>\n<li><code>retry:</code> 重连延迟（毫秒）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sse-客户端-api\">SSE 客户端 API</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const es = new EventSource(&#39;/events&#39;);&#10;&#10;es.addEventListener(&#39;message&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(event.data);&#10;});&#10;&#10;es.addEventListener(&#39;update&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  const data = JSON.parse(event.data);&#10;  console.log(data);&#10;});&#10;&#10;es.addEventListener(&#39;error&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.error(&#39;Error&#39;);&#10;});&#10;&#10;es.close();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const es = new EventSource('/events');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>es.addEventListener('message', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log(event.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>es.addEventListener('update', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const data = JSON.parse(event.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>es.addEventListener('error', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.error('Error');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>es.close();</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>自动重连特性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>浏览器内置自动重连。</li>\n<li>从上次事件 ID 恢复接收。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sse-服务端实现-node-js\">SSE 服务端实现（Node.js）</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import express from &#39;express&#39;;&#10;&#10;const app = express();&#10;&#10;app.get(&#39;/events&#39;, (req, res) =&gt; {&#10;  res.set({&#10;    &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;text/event-stream&#39;,&#10;    &#39;Cache-Control&#39;: &#39;no-cache&#39;,&#10;    Connection: &#39;keep-alive&#39;,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const interval = setInterval(() =&gt; {&#10;    res.write(`data: ${JSON.stringify({ time: Date.now() })}\\n\\n`);&#10;  }, 1000);&#10;&#10;  req.on(&#39;close&#39;, () =&gt; clearInterval(interval));&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import express from 'express';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const app = express();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.get('/events', (req, res) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  res.set({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    'Content-Type': 'text/event-stream',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    'Cache-Control': 'no-cache',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Connection: 'keep-alive',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const interval = setInterval(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    res.write(`data: ${JSON.stringify({ time: Date.now() })}\\n\\n`);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, 1000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  req.on('close', () => clearInterval(interval));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[客户端] --&gt;|HTTP 请求| B[服务器]&#10;    B --&gt;|事件流| A&#10;    A --&gt;|断线自动重连| B\">graph LR\n    A[客户端] --&gt;|HTTP 请求| B[服务器]\n    B --&gt;|事件流| A\n    A --&gt;|断线自动重连| B</pre><h2 id=\"何时选择-websocket\">何时选择 WebSocket</h2><p><strong>需要双向通信时</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>即时聊天。</li>\n<li>协作编辑（如 Yjs 同步）。</li>\n<li>在线游戏。</li>\n<li>实时反馈交互。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>对延迟要求极高时</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>交易系统。</li>\n<li>实时光标同步。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>需要自定义协议时</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>二进制传输。</li>\n<li>长度前缀消息格式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"何时选择-sse\">何时选择 SSE</h2><p><strong>仅需服务器向客户端推送时</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通知推送。</li>\n<li>实时动态流（新闻、股票）。</li>\n<li>AI 流式输出（类 ChatGPT 体验）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>追求简单实现时</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于 HTTP 协议（防火墙友好）。</li>\n<li>内置自动重连。</li>\n<li>无需 WebSocket 的复杂性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>大多数场景的判断</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不需要双向通信 → 选 SSE。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"何时使用长轮询\">何时使用长轮询</h2><p><strong>兼容旧系统或作为降级方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>老旧浏览器。</li>\n<li>严格的防火墙环境。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>长轮询工作原理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>客户端发送 GET 请求 → 服务器保持连接直到有数据。</li>\n<li>响应后客户端立即重新发送 GET 请求。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>基本已被淘汰</strong>——SSE 和 WebSocket 已全面替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对比总结\">对比总结</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>WebSocket</th>\n<th>SSE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>API 风格</td>\n<td>有状态</td>\n<td>简洁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信方向</td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>仅服务器到客户端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据格式</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重连机制</td>\n<td>需手动实现</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>子协议支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背压处理</td>\n<td>需手动</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器支持</td>\n<td>广泛</td>\n<td>广泛</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"性能特征\">性能特征</h2><p><strong>WebSocket</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>延迟最低。</li>\n<li>持久连接。</li>\n<li>二进制传输高效。</li>\n<li>但服务器有状态（每连接占用内存）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>SSE</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每条消息有 HTTP 头部开销。</li>\n<li>仅支持文本。</li>\n<li>浏览器限制每个源约 6 个连接。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>优化方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在一个连接上复用多个流。</li>\n<li>WebSocket 子协议。</li>\n<li>HTTP/2 下的 SSE（突破 6 连接限制）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"扩展方案\">扩展方案</h2><p><strong>WebSocket 扩展</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有状态（每个连接维护房间/用户信息）。</li>\n<li>水平扩展困难——需要 Redis 发布/订阅实现跨服务器通信。</li>\n<li>单服务器约支撑 10 万连接（经过调优）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>SSE 扩展</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同样是每连接有状态。</li>\n<li>扩展挑战与 WebSocket 类似。</li>\n<li>但基于 HTTP 的特性更容易做负载均衡。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>典型架构</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"客户端 ↔ 负载均衡器 ↔ WS 服务器 1 / 2 / N ↔ Redis 发布/订阅\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>客户端 ↔ 负载均衡器 ↔ WS 服务器 1 / 2 / N ↔ Redis 发布/订阅</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>每个 WebSocket 服务器订阅 Redis 频道</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>从任意服务器接收消息。</li>\n<li>广播给本服务器上的客户端。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"重连机制\">重连机制</h2><p><strong>WebSocket 需手动实现</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"class ReconnectingWS {&#10;  connect() {&#10;    this.ws = new WebSocket(this.url);&#10;    this.ws.addEventListener(&#39;close&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;      setTimeout(() =&gt; this.connect(), this.backoff());&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;  backoff() {&#10;    return Math.min(1000 * 2 ** this.attempt++, 30000);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ReconnectingWS {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  connect() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.ws = new WebSocket(this.url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    this.ws.addEventListener('close', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setTimeout(() => this.connect(), this.backoff());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  backoff() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return Math.min(1000 * 2 ** this.attempt++, 30000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>SSE 自动重连</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无需手动处理。</li>\n<li>自动从最后一个事件 ID 恢复接收。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>推荐库</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>robust-websocket。</li>\n<li>ReconnectingWebSocket。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"心跳保活\">心跳保活</h2><p><strong>检测失效连接</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const interval = setInterval(() =&gt; {&#10;  if (ws.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN) {&#10;    ws.send(JSON.stringify({ type: &#39;ping&#39; }));&#10;  }&#10;}, 30000);&#10;&#10;ws.addEventListener(&#39;message&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  const data = JSON.parse(event.data);&#10;  if (data.type === &#39;pong&#39;) {&#10;    // 重置超时计时器&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const interval = setInterval(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (ws.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ws.send(JSON.stringify({ type: 'ping' }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, 30000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ws.addEventListener('message', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const data = JSON.parse(event.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (data.type === 'pong') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 重置超时计时器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>服务器需响应 pong 消息</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"认证方式\">认证方式</h2><p><strong>WebSocket 认证</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>浏览器 API 不支持自定义请求头。</li>\n<li>替代方案：<ul>\n<li>URL 中携带令牌：<code>wss://example.com/?token=xxx</code>。</li>\n<li>子协议：<code>new WebSocket(url, [&#39;Bearer.token123&#39;])</code>。</li>\n<li>连接建立后首条消息携带令牌。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>SSE 认证</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>支持 HTTP Cookie 和 Authorization 头部（需自定义实现）。</li>\n<li>但 EventSource 原生不支持自定义头部。</li>\n<li>通常使用 <code>?token=xxx</code> 查询参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"常见陷阱\">常见陷阱</h2><p><strong>1. 不实现重连</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>网络中断 → 用户连接丢失无法恢复。</li>\n<li>必须实现重连逻辑。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 不处理背压</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>发送速度过快 → 缓冲区溢出。</li>\n<li>需检查 readyState 和 bufferedAmount。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 不做心跳检测</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>连接可能已失效（代理超时断开）。</li>\n<li>心跳机制至关重要。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 令牌暴露在 URL 中</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>会记录在服务器访问日志中。</li>\n<li>存在泄露风险。</li>\n<li>使用短期令牌并定期轮换。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 不限制消息大小</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存在拒绝服务攻击风险。</li>\n<li>服务器端需做校验。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 不优雅关闭连接</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>消息传输中途强制断开。</li>\n<li>应使用关闭码和原因说明。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"websocket-子协议\">WebSocket 子协议</h2><p><strong>协商通信协议</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const ws = new WebSocket(&#39;wss://example.com&#39;, [&#39;chat.v2&#39;, &#39;chat.v1&#39;]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const ws = new WebSocket('wss://example.com', ['chat.v2', 'chat.v1']);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>服务器根据支持情况选择协议</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>使用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>协议版本管理。</li>\n<li>区分二进制和文本协议。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"二进制-websocket\">二进制 WebSocket</h2><p><strong>发送 Uint8Array 或 ArrayBuffer</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"ws.binaryType = &#39;arraybuffer&#39;;&#10;ws.send(new Uint8Array([1, 2, 3]).buffer);&#10;&#10;ws.addEventListener(&#39;message&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  if (event.data instanceof ArrayBuffer) {&#10;    // 二进制数据&#10;  } else {&#10;    // 文本数据&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>ws.binaryType = 'arraybuffer';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ws.send(new Uint8Array([1, 2, 3]).buffer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ws.addEventListener('message', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (event.data instanceof ArrayBuffer) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 二进制数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 文本数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>游戏状态同步。</li>\n<li>压缩数据传输。</li>\n<li>Avro / Protobuf 编码消息。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sse-用于-ai-流式输出\">SSE 用于 AI 流式输出</h2><p><strong>类 ChatGPT 流式效果</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const es = new EventSource(&#39;/api/chat?prompt=...&#39;);&#10;let response = &#39;&#39;;&#10;&#10;es.addEventListener(&#39;message&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  if (event.data === &#39;[DONE]&#39;) {&#10;    es.close();&#10;    return;&#10;  }&#10;  response += event.data;&#10;  updateUI(response);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const es = new EventSource('/api/chat?prompt=...');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let response = '';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>es.addEventListener('message', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (event.data === '[DONE]') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    es.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  response += event.data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  updateUI(response);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>服务端处理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>逐字流式输出 LLM 生成的 token。</li>\n<li>每个 token 作为一个 SSE 事件发送。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"现代趋势\">现代趋势</h2><p><strong>1. 边缘 WebSocket</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cloudflare Durable Objects。</li>\n<li>每个房间具有强一致性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. WebTransport</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于 HTTP/3。</li>\n<li>WebSocket 的替代方案。</li>\n<li>支持多路复用和不可靠传输模式。</li>\n<li>浏览器支持正在扩展。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. SSE 用于 AI</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ChatGPT、Claude 都采用 SSE 流式输出。</li>\n<li>已成为主流应用场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 所有场景都用 WebSocket</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对简单通知来说开销过大。</li>\n<li>仅需服务器推送时应使用 SSE。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 从零实现重连逻辑</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>应使用成熟的库。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 不做心跳检测</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>连接失效无法被发现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 高频消息使用 JSON</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>解析速度慢。</li>\n<li>应使用二进制格式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 单服务器架构</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>应使用 Redis 或集群方案。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战建议\">实战建议</h2><p><strong>1. 选择合适的传输协议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>WebSocket：双向通信/低延迟场景。</li>\n<li>SSE：服务器推送/简单场景/流式输出。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 生产环境使用成熟库</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ws（Node.js）。</li>\n<li>socket.io（功能完备的方案）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 实现心跳检测</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通常设置 30 秒间隔。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 实现指数退避重连</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>延迟上限为 30 秒。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 使用短期令牌认证</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>定期轮换令牌。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 测试断线场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>网络中断、设备休眠、代理超时。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>WebSocket（2011）和 SSE（2009）是 Web 实时通信的两大传输协议。WebSocket 提供双向长连接，适合聊天、协作编辑、游戏等低延迟场景；SSE 是基于 HTTP 的服务器到客户端单向流，适合通知推送、实时动态和 AI 流式输出，且内置自动重连。WebSocket 通过 HTTP 升级建立连接（101 协议切换），之后在持久化 TCP 连接上传输二进制或文本帧。客户端使用 <code>new WebSocket</code> 并监听 open/message/close/error 事件。SSE 使用 <code>Content-Type: text/event-stream</code>，格式包含 <code>data:</code>、<code>event:</code>、<code>id:</code>、<code>retry:</code> 字段。性能方面，WebSocket 延迟最低但服务器有状态，SSE 有 HTTP 头开销且浏览器限制连接数（HTTP/2 可突破）。扩展方面，两者都需要 Redis 发布/订阅等方案实现跨服务器通信。认证方面，两者都不方便设置自定义头部，通常通过 URL 参数或首条消息携带令牌。现代趋势包括边缘 WebSocket（Cloudflare Durable Objects）、WebTransport（HTTP/3 替代方案）以及 SSE 用于 AI 流式输出。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WebSocket 与 SSE","id":"websocket-与-sse"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"WebSocket 协议","id":"websocket-协议"},{"level":2,"text":"客户端 API","id":"客户端-api"},{"level":2,"text":"服务端实现（Node.js）","id":"服务端实现-node-js"},{"level":2,"text":"SSE 协议","id":"sse-协议"},{"level":2,"text":"SSE 客户端 API","id":"sse-客户端-api"},{"level":2,"text":"SSE 服务端实现（Node.js）","id":"sse-服务端实现-node-js"},{"level":2,"text":"何时选择 WebSocket","id":"何时选择-websocket"},{"level":2,"text":"何时选择 SSE","id":"何时选择-sse"},{"level":2,"text":"何时使用长轮询","id":"何时使用长轮询"},{"level":2,"text":"对比总结","id":"对比总结"},{"level":2,"text":"性能特征","id":"性能特征"},{"level":2,"text":"扩展方案","id":"扩展方案"},{"level":2,"text":"重连机制","id":"重连机制"},{"level":2,"text":"心跳保活","id":"心跳保活"},{"level":2,"text":"认证方式","id":"认证方式"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱","id":"常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"WebSocket 子协议","id":"websocket-子协议"},{"level":2,"text":"二进制 WebSocket","id":"二进制-websocket"},{"level":2,"text":"SSE 用于 AI 流式输出","id":"sse-用于-ai-流式输出"},{"level":2,"text":"现代趋势","id":"现代趋势"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战建议","id":"实战建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"WebRTC 与点对点通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/realtime-collaborative-frontend/realtime-foundations/webrtc-peer-to-peer"}}